  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soil fertility training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project introduces and enhances soil regeneration techniques and use of biofertilisers in Chad. This will be done by training extension officers of the ongoing Horti Hub Chad project, local extension service providers and agricultural research institutes. A training program for farmers and growers in Chad is designed and through a training-of-trainers program, a pool of local qualified extension officers trained to coach and assist farmers and growers on soil regeneration practices and biofertilisers to promote sustainable and self-sufficient agricultural practices.</narrative>
  </description>
